****Important tip****
If the report controller does not have any reportname or method reportname, you should look for the formletter structure.
In case of using reportname after editing the print mgmt class, the changes below are also required.
If it is using the formletter instead, the print mgmt extension is enough without controller changes.


[ExtensionOf(classStr(AFPPurchaseOrderDraftController))]
final class AFPPurchaseOrderDraftController_Alfazance_Extension
{
    public SRSCatalogItemName parmReportName(SRSCatalogItemName _reportName)
    {

        next parmReportName(_reportName);

        reportName = ssrsReportStr(AFZPurchPurchaseOrderDraft, Report);
        return reportName;

    }

}
